              "label": "Exact-ID validation failure and local-label correction"
            },
            {
              "documentId": "traj-zxiong-codex-c4c6af085497b69d",
              "eventId": "evt-58e370c7e47a12d01ff00ab292d306967dcf58e33e3c231d8ba009984c111f6f",
              "label": "Recovered smoke lane and clean parallel judges"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "guarded-multipartition-execution",
          "text": "The execution design changed again when the evaluation lead asked for broader simultaneous CPU eligibility and then requested test as well. Because test could not be combined with the other partitions in one Slurm list, the pending Luna work was represented by two mutually exclusive queue entries sharing one lock and one resumable output. The test entry started first; the unused multi-partition entry was canceled with zero runtime, leaving one active runner and no duplicate API execution.",
          "evidence": [
            {
              "documentId": "traj-zxiong-codex-c4c6af085497b69d",
              "eventId": "evt-f3ba2da52214bbdc8ffd0bd0845fac3768de2b8b53f58828ff8e453ae047d453",
              "label": "Request for simultaneous multi-partition eligibility"
            },
            {
              "documentId": "traj-zxiong-codex-c4c6af085497b69d",
              "eventId": "evt-8224e58ef6ff2b95a234cbf63e0b9ecedf12ca02a0eed6d2478216f1fe5cd34d",
              "label": "Request to include test for Luna"
            },
            {
              "documentId": "traj-zxiong-codex-c4c6af085497b69d",
              "eventId": "evt-41372877d5e12cca59b60ed96e1c3e3a7566cc0e998cee5574c01c7b01fd6420",
              "label": "Mutually exclusive guarded Luna queue entries"
            },
            {
              "documentId": "traj-zxiong-codex-19fd7078bb29d827",
              "eventId": "evt-4efc86bf851398f99a6abc002e6674f5610427e299b4fdd24c53f113a5293805",
              "label": "Single active runner after zero-runtime cancellation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "partial-cross-model-handoff",
          "text": "The latest handoff extended the judge coverage without rerunning already completed comparisons. Luna began judging Gemini trajectories and Gemini began judging Luna trajectories, each supplement reusing existing reference scores and evaluating only the missing candidate. Both jobs were running on test with zero errors at the recorded checkpoint, but their merged four-model reports were still partial and required regeneration after completion.",
          "evidence": [
            {
              "documentId": "traj-zxiong-codex-19fd7078bb29d827",
              "eventId": "evt-795fb591a27fd404c0be0c4de672772bd66cec24769016140a2f163625d3f0d3",
              "label": "Running cross-model supplements and partial-report state"
            }
