              "eventId": "evt-493283dcf58f2e7bbcbec07eeb2324ba3c1a80a8b9ed88f820f7e18964bfd349"
            },
            {
              "documentId": "traj-zxiong-codex-19fd7078bb29d827",
              "eventId": "evt-3f388a824a7a145fbe863d02b590e66e8b5206a75090adbfd204c38cef00a43c"
            },
            {
              "documentId": "traj-zxiong-codex-19fd7078bb29d827",
              "eventId": "evt-31399cde162cf7d4630af5008f7c0fafbc56f2f8c220ceaa9a823463dfe99dcc"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "uncertainty": "The reviewed record ends while the pair-gap Kendall tau is being recomputed on audit-non-tied instances, so whether score collisions explain the near-zero instance-level relationship remains unresolved."
