          "id": "build-a-reusable-analysis-base",
          "text": "The analysis began as infrastructure rather than a one-off comparison. The implementation agent proposed a model-agnostic command-line workflow over persisted result files and copied ground-truth data, with schema normalization, one tokenizer configuration, pluggable metrics, per-task and per-model aggregation, and machine-readable output. The first end-to-end pass completed over 2,400 episodes from three models and all eight tasks without missing-ground-truth warnings. Gemini then supplied a fourth complete 800-episode run with zero errors and a mean reward of 0.5250, allowing the same report to compare four full model suites instead of mixing complete and partial evidence.",
