          {
            "id": "evaluator-foundation-validated-base",
            "text": "The corrected foundation was validated in stages. Live routing preflights covered both the ordinary interaction path and the separate document generator, and a completed model output could be retained as the source for a fixed-auxiliary HUMANUAL rerun. Later judge-only comparisons finished 200 of 200 items for each judge with zero errors, showing that the reusable routing and persistence paths held under a complete run. The foundation did not erase every external limit: free routes blocked by provider policy still required an access decision, but those failures were now separated from evaluator correctness and no longer consumed full-run submissions.",
