            "id": "scope-and-metric-corrections",
            "text": "The visual collection changed as the distinction between candidate models and evaluators was refined. One regeneration used only GPT-5.4 nano as evaluator; a later correction instead removed Luna and Gemini from the simulator series while retaining them as evaluators, and rebuilt the PNG, SVG, subset, ranking, and documentation outputs. Metric definitions also tightened: SimulatorArena reward was limited to writing- and conversation-style fidelity, with document quality and fulfillment retained only as diagnostics, while fractional win rate explicitly split credit among tied top scores.",
            "evidence": [
