            "id": "build-qa-and-handoff",
            "text": "The local build path initially lacked slide-generation and office-export libraries, but a usable toolchain was found and the deck was generated from a shared scene specification so the PowerPoint remained editable and the PDF matched it closely. The first full build contained 18 slides—12 core and six appendix—with notes on every slide and passed structural validation. Visual review still found a legend collision, clipped score and win labels, and tight multiline titles and callouts. Those defects were corrected before both formats were regenerated. The final handoff passed structural and visual QA, matched numeric summaries to local analysis artifacts, paraphrased the two examples, made no new evaluation calls, and left the original brief and deck unchanged.",
