    "overview": "The evaluation method moved from raw cross-model scores to controlled, judge-only comparisons over fixed trajectories. Anonymous ordering, fractional tie credit, role isolation, preflight corrections, reversal tests, and explicit audit formulas made the comparisons reproducible while preserving calibration, support, and score-direction caveats.",
